    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEm">II Em</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be ðon ðe mon oþerne on cyricean gesece oþþe on cyninges burh.] [Ld] Gif hwa cyrcan gesece oððe mine burh ⁊ hine man ðær sece oððe yflige—ða ðe ðæt don syn ðæs ylcon scyldige ðe hit her beforan cweð.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone flees [for sanctuary] to a church or to my premises, and anyone attacks or injures him there, those who do do shall incur the penalty which has already been stated.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa cyrican gesece oððe mine burh, ⁊ hine man ðær sece oððe yflyge: ða þe ðæt doð, syn ðæs ylcon scyldige, ðe hit her beforan cweð.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
